 data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$360/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$465/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.67.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">September 21st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Magmite</b> is an uncommon, bright yellow ore found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a> within <a href=\"/wiki/Flameslate\" title=\"Flameslate\">Flameslate</a> nodes.\n</p><p>This ore is unique, as when it is not in contact to heat, it will start cooling down, transitioning to a redder hue up until it completely cools, turning the ore into <a href=\"/wiki/Obsidian\" title=\"Obsidian\">Obsidian</a>. This process takes <b>2 Minutes and 45 Seconds</b> to complete, so be sure to keep the ores warm and bring them to a heat source quickly.\n</p><p>To heat up the ore, you can make the ore sit over a lava pool, keep it in contact with <a href=\"/wiki/Boxed_Lava\" title=\"Boxed Lava\">Boxed Lava</a>, or put it in a <a href=\"/wiki/Storage_Drawer\" title=\"Storage Drawer\">Storage Drawer</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Large_Crate\" title=\"Large Crate\">Crate</a>, as it will not cool down and will stay the color it is. When this ore is refined or forged, it will no longer cool down, similarly to how <a href=\"/wiki/Boomite\" title=\"Boomite\">Boomite</a> wont explode after refining or forging.\n</p><p>It is recommended to heat the ore until it turns yellow before leaving the cave. While it turns  red fast, it stills take some time to turn into obsidian.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901110136\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 64/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019429/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.432      1 Template:Ore\n100.00%   29.432      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3284-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901110136 and revision id 22107. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Ores"],"links":[{"title":"Boomite","exists":true},{"title":"Boxed Lava","exists":true},{"title":"Flameslate","exists":true},{"title":"Large Crate","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Caves","exists